            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience that &quot;nooooo, they're falling!&quot; feeling all over again.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domino VR is a sandbox about one thing: building domino chains and watching them fall. Place dominoes one by one or paint long rows with a sweep of your hand. Bend them around corners, run them up stairs and over bridges, and let a ball roll down a ramp to start the next part. Then push the first one and hope you didn't knock it over by accident. (You will.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/73fb9bd118ccde726508621af57dcd92.poster.avif?t=1793813971\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/73fb9bd118ccde726508621af57dcd92.webm?t=1793813971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/73fb9bd118ccde726508621af57dcd92.mp4?t=1793813971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domino VR first came out in 2016 and has since been rebuilt from scratch, with new physics, controls, art and sound, 24 puzzle levels and a level editor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-scale dominoes:</strong> sized and weighted like the real thing, with a preview before you place. Grab them, throw them, undo the last one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands at once:</strong> up to 20,000 dominoes per world on PC. When a giant chain gets heavy, the simulation slows down a little instead of stuttering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contraptions:</strong> ramps and balls, bridges, stairs and a bell; a crane, a rotator, a pendulum and a seesaw catapult; a conveyor belt, a fan, a bounce pad, a cannon, a domino blaster and a finish gate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Placing car and stamps</strong>: the car drives off and lays a line of dominoes behind it, the line and curve stamps put down a whole row at once.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools on your wrist:</strong> colour, weld (glue dominoes together or pin them in mid-air) and destroy, plus props, undo and the menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World controls:</strong> gravity, slow motion, pause, player size and reset.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/c38cc68c8fe7e88a87e41cb46619c6a9.poster.avif?t=1793813971\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/c38cc68c8fe7e88a87e41cb46619c6a9.webm?t=1793813971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/c38cc68c8fe7e88a87e41cb46619c6a9.mp4?t=1793813971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 puzzle levels:</strong> three short tutorials, then 21 puzzles. Ring the bell, climb the stairs, cross gaps, sweep, swing and catapult. Each level has a domino budget and up to three stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor:</strong> build your own puzzle levels in the game, test them and beat them before you save, then share them on the Steam Workshop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/5f4e8e48ad28cbb17665001128a18c5a.poster.avif?t=1793813971\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/5f4e8e48ad28cbb17665001128a18c5a.webm?t=1793813971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/5f4e8e48ad28cbb17665001128a18c5a.mp4?t=1793813971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Worlds</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Workshop</strong>: a cosy room with a big table, a rug, shelves and toys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest Island</strong>: a stone plaza and a meadow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Room (Steam Frame)</strong>: build in your own room with <strong>passthrough</strong>, on your real floor and tables.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/d83bceb17a183f0d8f6b2d3d480c72e0.avif?t=1793813971\" width=1232 height=692 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and load worlds:</strong> as many save slots as you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop:</strong> share your worlds and levels, and browse, subscribe to and load other people's creations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build together (experimental):</strong> host a world for friends through Steam, or join one from your friends list.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator camera:</strong> show its view on your desktop for friends watching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo camera:</strong> photos land in your Pictures folder and your Steam screenshots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera paths:</strong> fly a smooth camera along your chain for videos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comfort</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport or smooth movement, and snap or smooth turning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vignette, seated mode and a left-handed mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate volume sliders and adjustable haptics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Headsets</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC VR through OpenXR:</strong> Valve Index, HTC Vive, Meta Quest via Link/Air Link/Steam Link, and other OpenXR headsets with tracked controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Frame:</strong> runs natively on the headset, no PC needed (up to 5,000 dominoes per world).</p></li></ul>",
