veyor belt, a fan, a bounce pad, a cannon, a domino blaster and a finish gate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Placing car and stamps</strong>: the car drives off and lays a line of dominoes behind it, the line and curve stamps put down a whole row at once.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools on your wrist:</strong> colour, weld (glue dominoes together or pin them in mid-air) and destroy, plus props, undo and the menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World controls:</strong> gravity, slow motion, pause, player size and reset.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/c38cc68c8fe7e88a87e41cb46619c6a9.poster.avif?t=1793813971\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/c38cc68c8fe7e88a87e41cb46619c6a9.webm?t=1793813971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/c38cc68c8fe7e88a87e41cb46619c6a9.mp4?t=1793813971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 puzzle levels:</strong> three short tutorials, then 21 puzzles. Ring the bell, climb the stairs, cross gaps, sweep, swing and catapult. Each level has a domino budget and up to three stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor:</strong> build your own puzzle levels in the game, test them and beat them before you save, then share them on the Steam Workshop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508680/extras/5f4e8e48ad28cbb17665001128a18c5a.poster.avif?t=1793813971\" width=616 hei